[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2100.069, "timestamp": "00:35:00", "text": "这不是字段，我该如何添加？所以，它现在在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2104.63, "timestamp": "00:35:04", "text": "最底部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2108.47, "timestamp": "00:35:08", "text": "数组中的所有元素。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2110.47, "timestamp": "00:35:10", "text": "这看起来似乎可行，但充电或许能解决问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2112.069, "timestamp": "00:35:12", "text": "你的小物件可能还在某个地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2117.349, "timestamp": "00:35:17", "text": "赶紧恐慌吧，伙计。我的天啊，它不会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2120.249, "timestamp": "00:35:20", "text": "死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2141.91, "timestamp": "00:35:41", "text": "应用程序位置结束。那不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2148.069, "timestamp": "00:35:48", "text": "对吧？是吗？等等，稍等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2151.19, "timestamp": "00:35:51", "text": "耽误。等一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2154.23, "timestamp": "00:35:54", "text": "让我用这些垃圾文件中的一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2156.55, "timestamp": "00:35:56", "text": "是的，我会用这个。等等，那不是……"}]